            "value" : "仅对话"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Chat only can't be applied to this session — %@'s tool-policy file has a shape SipAI doesn't know." : {
      "comment" : "Runner error: a kimi session's tool-policy/state.json is not the measured shape; placeholder is the agent label",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "无法对此会话使用“仅对话”——%@ 的工具策略文件格式 SipAI 不认识。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Chat only can't be applied to this session — its folder in %@'s store could not be found." : {
      "comment" : "Runner error: a kimi session directory is missing for a Chat only turn; placeholder is the agent label",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "无法对此会话使用“仅对话”——在 %@ 的存储中找不到它的文件夹。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Chat only could not be prepared: %@" : {
      "comment" : "Runner error when the Chat only persona file cannot be written; placeholder is the system's error text",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "无法准备“仅对话”：%@"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Chat only is a row in an agent session's mode chip. A turn sent under it carries none of the agent's file or command tools and no MCP servers — except that %@ keeps any you added to its own config — so the agent can't read, search or change files or run commands, but, like a chat app, it can still look things up on the web when a question needs current information. It answers in the same session, and the next turn in any other row continues the conversation with the tools back. It draws on whatever the tool is signed in to: %@ uses your Claude plan, %@ uses your Codex limits (a ChatGPT plan's Codex allowance, not its chat allowance), %@ uses your Kimi Code membership — and a tool signed in with an API key bills that key. A short exchange costs far less than a full agent turn, and switching rows re-caches the conversation once. To share a file, attach it with the + or drop it on the box: text files and PDF text travel inside the message, and an image goes to the model as an image (on %@, only in a new session's first message). On a new %@ session the first Chat only message arrives all at once; later ones stream. %@ searches the web only when it has a search provider, which a Kimi Code membership login provides; with an API key alone it can open a page but not search." : {
      "comment" : "FAQ answer: the Chat only mode; placeholders are the three agent labels",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "“仅对话”是智能体会话模式菜单中的一项。在这一模式下发送的消息不携带智能体的任何文件或命令工具，也不带 MCP 服务器——只是 %@ 会保留你在它自己的配置里添加的那些——因此智能体无法读取、搜索或修改文件，也不能运行命令；但它仍会像聊天应用那样，在问题需要最新信息时上网查找。它在同一个会话里作答，之后在其他任一模式下发送的消息会带着工具继续这段对话。它使用该工具所登录的账户：%@ 使用你的 Claude 套餐，%@ 使用你的 Codex 额度（ChatGPT 套餐中的 Codex 额度，而非其对话额度），%@ 使用你的 Kimi Code 会员；以 API 密钥登录的工具则由该密钥计费。一次简短的问答比一个完整的智能体回合便宜得多；切换模式会让对话重新缓存一次。要分享文件，请用 + 附加或把文件拖到输入框上：文本文件和 PDF 的文字会随消息一起发送，图片则作为图片发给模型（在 %@ 上，仅限新会话的第一条消息）。在新的 %@ 会话中，第一条“仅对话”消息会一次性到达，之后的消息则会流式显示。%@ 只有在配置了搜索服务时才会上网搜索（登录 Kimi Code 会员即自带一个）；仅使用 API 密钥时，它可以打开网页，但不能搜索。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Chat Prompt and Roles" : {
      "comment" : "Settings section title: the system prompt and roles sent with chat messages.",
      "isCommentAutoGenerated" : true,
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "对话提示词与角色"
