    },
    "Chats" : {
      "comment" : "Sidebar section header",
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Chats"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "对话"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Chats talk directly to a model over your API key — pure conversation, billed per token. Agent sessions run the provider's CLI (e.g. Claude Code, Codex) on your Mac: the agent can read and edit files and run commands, and billing follows the CLI's own login or plan. Chats are stored by this app; agent sessions are the CLIs (or Apps)' own files, which SipAI reads and follows live." : {
      "comment" : "FAQ answer: chats vs agent sessions",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "对话通过你的 API 密钥直接与模型通信——纯粹的对话，按 token 计费。智能体会话则是在你的 Mac 上运行提供商的 CLI（例如 Claude Code、Codex）：智能体可以读取和修改文件、执行命令，计费方式取决于该 CLI 自己的登录账号或套餐。对话由本 App 保存；智能体会话是这些 CLI（或 App）自己的文件，SipAI 只是读取并实时跟随。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Chats, chat groups, notes, models, API keys, scheduled tasks, and every setting are wiped, and the app returns to first-run setup. Agent turns running right now are stopped. Left alone, because they live outside the app: the agent CLIs' own sessions — including transcripts of scheduled runs that already happened — and anything inside your dedicated folder. This cannot be undone." : {
      "comment" : "Body of the factory reset confirmation",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "对话、对话分组、笔记、模型、API 密钥、计划任务以及所有设置都会被清除，App 将回到首次启动的设置流程。正在运行的智能体回合会被停止。以下内容不受影响，因为它们不在 App 内部：各智能体 CLI 自己的会话——包括已发生的计划运行记录——以及你专用文件夹中的一切。此操作无法撤销。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
