        }
      }
    },
    "Its sessions stay on disk; its section leaves the sidebar until you sign in again. Every API-key provider is removed from kimi's config.toml through kimi's own command, with the model aliases that referenced them." : {
      "comment" : "Agent Guide: body of the sign-out confirmation for a key-based kimi",
