        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "仅在我手动运行时"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Open Add Model and pick the provider again — Continue re-validates the stored key by fetching its model list, and the error it shows names the actual cause. The usual suspects: the key belongs to a different region (Qwen, Kimi — switch region on the key step), the account has no credit, or the model ID no longer exists. If you entered an environment variable name instead of a key, note that apps launched from the Dock don't see shell exports — paste the key itself, or launch SipAI from a terminal." : {
      "comment" : "FAQ answer: debugging failing requests",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "打开「添加模型」并重新选择该提供商——点击「继续」会通过获取模型列表来重新验证已存储的密钥，报出的错误会指明真正的原因。常见情况有：密钥属于另一个地区（通义千问、Kimi——请在密钥步骤切换地区）、账号没有余额，或该模型 ID 已不存在。如果你填的是环境变量名而不是密钥，请注意从程序坞启动的 App 读不到 shell 中的 export——请直接粘贴密钥，或从终端启动 SipAI。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Open or start an agent session to begin." : {
      "comment" : "Center column state when no session is resolved at all",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "打开或新建一个智能体会话即可开始。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Open schedule options" : {
      "comment" : "Tooltip for the armed-schedule banner",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "打开计划选项"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Open Settings → Agent Guide. Install runs the provider's own installer, Sign In opens the provider's sign-in page (a subscription) or takes an API key, and the provider appears in the sidebar once both are done. Installing or signing in from Terminal works the same way; SipAI notices within a few seconds. Only providers that are installed and signed in are listed — the sidebar's ADD AGENTS row opens the same page." : {
      "comment" : "FAQ answer: agent CLI setup",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "打开“设置 → 智能体指南”。“安装”会运行提供商自己的安装程序，“登录”会打开提供商的登录页面（订阅）或接受 API 密钥，两者完成后该提供商就会出现在侧边栏。在“终端”里安装或登录也一样有效；SipAI 会在几秒内检测到。只有已安装并已登录的提供商才会被列出——侧边栏的“添加智能体”一行会打开同一个页面。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "OpenAI's checksum file could not be fetched, so nothing was downloaded." : {
      "comment" : "Agent Guide: the codex package's checksum list did not download",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "无法获取 OpenAI 的校验文件，因此没有下载任何内容。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "OpenAI's model pages list a 1,050,000-token context window for GPT-6-Astra, GPT-5.6-Sol, and other recent models. %@'s own model catalog runs these models with a default context window of %@ tokens and keeps %lld%% of it effective — %@ tokens, the %@ in the chip." : {
      "comment" : "Help card, paragraph 1; placeholders are the Codex label, a grouped token count, a percentage, a grouped token count and a compact token count",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "OpenAI 的模型页面为 GPT-6-Astra、GPT-5.6-Sol 等近期模型列出了 1,050,000 token 的上下文窗口。%@ 自己的模型目录让这些模型以 %@ token 的默认上下文窗口运行，并保留其中 %lld%% 作为有效窗口——即 %@ token，也就是输入框下方显示的 %@。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
