    "Show %@ in SipAI. Unticked, it stays installed and signed in on this Mac, but its sessions leave the sidebar and search, its scheduled tasks stop running, and nothing about it is shown or checked until you tick it again." : {
      "comment" : "Agent Guide: hover on the show/hide checkbox; placeholder is the agent's name",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "在 SipAI 中显示 %@。取消勾选后，它在这台 Mac 上仍保持安装和登录，但会话会从侧边栏和搜索中消失，计划任务停止运行，且不再显示或检查与它相关的任何内容，直到重新勾选。"
