        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "正在退出登录…"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "SipAI %@ will install once the running turn finishes." : {
      "comment" : "Sidebar, in place of the SipAI wordmark for a few seconds: the user chose to wait for a running agent turn before an update installs; placeholder is the new version",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "SipAI %@ 将在正在进行的智能体回合结束后安装。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "SipAI asks each tool's own release endpoint — the npm registry, or the vendor's version file — every few hours whether a newer version exists. Nothing about you or your machine is sent. A tool is updated only by running its own update command, or, where that command declines and names the vendor's installer instead, by running that installer pinned to the version shown." : {
      "comment" : "Updates pane: what the CLI version check does",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "SipAI 会每隔几小时向每个工具自己的发布接口（npm 仓库，或厂商的版本文件）查询是否有更新的版本。不会发送任何关于你或你的电脑的信息。更新工具时只会运行该工具自带的更新命令；若该命令拒绝更新并指向厂商的安装脚本，则运行该安装脚本，并固定为所显示的版本。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "SipAI asks updates.sipai.dev once a day whether a newer version exists. Nothing is downloaded until you choose to install it, and no usage data, account or system profile is ever sent." : {
      "comment" : "Updates pane: what the automatic check does",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "SipAI 每天向 updates.sipai.dev 查询一次是否有新版本。在你选择安装之前不会下载任何内容，也不会发送任何使用数据、账号或系统概况。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "SipAI could not write this note's file. Your changes are still here — they will be saved again on the next edit." : {
      "comment" : "Tooltip explaining the note save failure badge",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "SipAI 无法写入这条笔记的文件。你的修改仍然保留——下次编辑时会再次尝试保存。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "SipAI downloads Anthropic's installer from claude.ai and runs it. It installs to ~/.local/bin and may add that folder to your shell's PATH so Terminal finds it too. About 200 MB." : {
      "comment" : "Agent Guide: install confirmation body for Claude Code",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "SipAI 将从 claude.ai 下载 Anthropic 的安装程序并运行。它会安装到 ~/.local/bin，并可能把该目录加入 shell 的 PATH，以便“终端”也能找到它。约 200 MB。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "SipAI downloads Moonshot's installer from code.kimi.com and runs it. It installs to ~/.kimi-code/bin and adds that folder to your shell's PATH." : {
      "comment" : "Agent Guide: install confirmation body for Kimi Code",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "SipAI 将从 code.kimi.com 下载 Moonshot 的安装程序并运行。它会安装到 ~/.kimi-code/bin，并把该目录加入 shell 的 PATH。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "SipAI downloads OpenAI's release package (about 120 MB) from github.com/openai/codex, checks it against OpenAI's checksum file, and installs it under ~/.local/share/sipai/codex with a codex command in ~/.local/bin — adding that folder to your shell's PATH if Terminal does not see it yet. SipAI keeps this copy up to date from the same place; if you would rather have Homebrew or npm manage it, install it there yourself and SipAI will use that copy instead." : {
      "comment" : "Agent Guide: install confirmation body for Codex",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "SipAI 将从 github.com/openai/codex 下载 OpenAI 的发布包（约 120 MB），用 OpenAI 的校验文件核对后安装到 ~/.local/share/sipai/codex，并在 ~/.local/bin 放置 codex 命令——如果“终端”还找不到它，会把该目录加入 shell 的 PATH。SipAI 会从同一来源保持这份副本为最新；如果你更愿意用 Homebrew 或 npm 管理，请自行在那里安装，SipAI 会改用那份副本。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "SipAI is completely a local tool. Chats, notes, roles, and settings live in ~/Library/Application Support/SipAI, and API keys stay in that folder's config.json on your disk. Messages are sent only to the provider of the model you picked — there is no server in between. Agent sessions are stored by the CLIs themselves, under ~/.claude, ~/.codex and ~/.kimi-code. Besides that, SipAI only checks for updates — for itself once a day, and for the agent tools every eight hours — sending nothing about you, and both checks can be turned off in Settings → Updates." : {
      "comment" : "FAQ answer: data storage and privacy",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "SipAI 完全是一个本地工具。对话、笔记、角色和设置保存在 ~/Library/Application Support/SipAI，API 密钥保存在该文件夹的 config.json 中，都在你自己的磁盘上。消息只会发送给你所选模型的提供商——中间没有任何服务器。智能体会话则由各 CLI 自己保存在 ~/.claude、~/.codex 和 ~/.kimi-code 下。此外，SipAI 只会检查更新——每天检查一次自身的更新，每八小时检查一次智能体工具的更新——不会发送任何关于你的信息，这两项检查都可以在“设置 → 更新”中关闭。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "SipAI runs each supported provider's own command-line tool on this Mac and shows its sessions in the sidebar. You must have access to a provider before you can use its tool in SipAI — some AI providers aren't available in every country or region." : {
      "comment" : "Agent Guide intro, first paragraph: what SipAI runs, and that access to the provider comes first",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "SipAI 在这台 Mac 上运行每家受支持提供商自己的命令行工具，并把它的会话显示在侧边栏。你必须先拥有某家提供商的使用权限，才能在 SipAI 中使用它的工具——部分 AI 提供商并非在所有国家或地区都提供服务。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "SipAI will install the update and relaunch once the work finishes. Interrupting stops that work now, the same as quitting, and installs right away. If you quit SipAI before then, the update is installed on the way out and SipAI stays closed." : {
      "comment" : "Update-hold sheet body: the choice between waiting for the running turn and interrupting it",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "SipAI 会在这些工作结束后安装更新并重新启动。“中断”会立即停止这些工作（与退出相同）并马上安装。若在此之前退出 SipAI，更新会在退出过程中安装，SipAI 不会重新打开。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Sipping…" : {
      "comment" : "Shown while waiting for the model",
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
