      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "无法写入 PDF 文件。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The provider's model list could not be fetched, so nothing was written." : {
      "comment" : "Agent Guide: kimi's catalog listing failed before the key sign-in",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "无法获取该提供商的模型列表，因此未写入任何内容。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The region entry must be a full URL starting with http:// or https://." : {
      "comment" : "Model setup: custom region text rejected at save time",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "地区输入必须是以 http:// 或 https:// 开头的完整 URL。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The run could not be started." : {
      "comment" : "Scheduled-run failure: the runner refused to start the turn",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "无法启动本次运行。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The run exited with code %d." : {
      "comment" : "Scheduled-run failure: nonzero exit",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "本次运行已退出，退出码 %d。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The same catalog allows the window to be raised to %@ tokens, of which %@ are effective; that is the figure the chip shows once the setting is changed." : {
      "comment" : "Help card, paragraph 1 continued; placeholders are two grouped token counts",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "同一目录允许把窗口提高到 %@ token，其中 %@ 为有效窗口；更改设置后，输入框下方显示的就是这个数字。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The sign-in address was not on %@ and was not opened." : {
      "comment" : "Agent Guide: codex handed back a login URL on an unexpected host; placeholder is the expected host",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "登录地址不在 %@ 上，未打开。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The sign-in did not complete." : {
      "comment" : "Agent Guide: the tool's login exited without signing in and printed nothing",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "登录未完成。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The system prompt (Settings → Chat Prompt and Roles) is the standing instruction sent with every chat message. Roles are named prompts you can switch between, so the same chat window can answer as a code reviewer, translator, or tutor. One starter role ships with the app as a worked example — edit it, delete it, or add your own." : {
      "comment" : "FAQ answer: system prompt and roles",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "系统提示词（“设置 → 对话提示词与角色”）是随每条对话消息一起发送的常驻指令。角色则是一组具名的提示词，你可以随时切换，让同一个对话窗口分别以代码审查员、翻译或老师的身份回答。App 内置了一个角色作为示例——你可以修改它、删除它，或添加自己的角色。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The task file could not be written." : {
      "comment" : "Scheduled-task error: SKILL.md write failed",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "无法写入任务文件。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The task has no prompt to run." : {
      "comment" : "Scheduled-run failure: SKILL.md body is empty",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "该任务没有可运行的任务描述。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The task's folder no longer exists: %@" : {
      "comment" : "Scheduled-run failure: cwd is gone",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "该任务的文件夹已不存在：%@"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The tool did not answer." : {
      "comment" : "Agent Guide: a request to the tool's own server got no answer inside the ceiling",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "工具没有回应。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The tool is still installed after the removal ran." : {
      "comment" : "Agent Guide: the delete plan ran and the binary is still found",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "移除操作运行后，工具仍处于安装状态。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The tool's app server could not be started." : {
      "comment" : "Agent Guide: codex's app-server did not start or complete its handshake",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "无法启动工具的应用服务器。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The tool's local server is busy with a sign-in. Try again in a moment." : {
      "comment" : "Plan-usage card: kimi's local server is held by the Agent Guide's sign-in flow",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "工具的本地服务器正忙于登录，请稍后再试。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The tool's own updater leaves this copy to %@, which SipAI does not run. Update it there, in Terminal." : {
      "comment" : "Updates pane: hover on a tool a package manager updates; placeholder is the package manager's name, e.g. Homebrew",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "该工具自带的更新程序把这个副本的更新交给了 %@，而 SipAI 不会运行它。请在终端里通过它更新。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The turn is still running, but nothing has come back for 5 minutes. This may be fine. However, if it persists for too long, it may indicate a blocked or misconfigured network route, which looks exactly like this because the agent retries in silence. In that case, please check your network connection and settings, or search online to see whether the AI provider is down." : {
      "comment" : "Body of the stalled-turn notice",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "这一回合仍在运行，但已经有 5 分钟没有任何返回。这可能没有问题；但如果持续太久，就可能是网络线路被拦截或配置有误——出现这种情况时看起来正是如此，因为智能体会静默重试。如果是这样，请检查你的网络连接和设置，或上网搜索该 AI 提供商的服务是否中断。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The updater printed nothing and did not exit cleanly." : {
      "comment" : "Updates pane detail: the CLI's updater produced no output, was stopped or could not be started, and the installed version did not change",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "更新程序没有输出任何内容，且未正常退出。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The updater printed nothing and exited with code %lld." : {
      "comment" : "Updates pane detail: the CLI's updater produced no output and the installed version did not change; placeholder is the exit code",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "更新程序没有输出任何内容，并以代码 %lld 退出。"
