        }
      }
    },
    "This copy of SipAI was built locally and is not signed for distribution, so it does not update itself. Copies from the release page check for updates automatically." : {
      "comment" : "Updates pane and app menu: hover on the greyed-out update controls, in a build that is not a signed release",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "此 SipAI 副本为本地构建，未经分发签名，因此不会自我更新。从发布页面下载的版本会自动检查更新。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This removes the %@ command-line tool, the same as uninstalling it in Terminal — here, %@. Its sessions, settings and sign-in stay in %@ and are back the moment you reinstall. Nothing else on your Mac is changed." : {
      "comment" : "Agent Guide: body of the delete confirmation; placeholders are the agent's name, the detected install route, and the tool's own data folder",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "这会移除 %1$@ 命令行工具，效果和在“终端”里卸载它一样——这里是 %2$@。它的会话、设置和登录信息仍保留在 %3$@ 中，重新安装后即可恢复。你的 Mac 上不会有其他改动。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
