    },
    "Xiaomi" : {
      "comment" : "Provider name; Chinese uses the company's own name",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "小米"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Yes — click the T icon beside the search icon in the toolbar. It appears when at least one of your agent tools is signed in to a plan (a Claude subscription, a ChatGPT plan for Codex, or a Kimi Code membership), and it shows what each plan reports: the current 5-hour session and weekly windows for Claude Code, the weekly and per-model limits for Codex, and the weekly quota and 5-hour window for Kimi Code. The numbers are fetched when you open the window and are as fresh as the time shown at the bottom; click the refresh arrow for a new reading. Each figure comes from the tool's own account query, run on your Mac by the tool itself: Claude Code answers its /usage command, Codex answers over its app server, and Kimi Code answers over its local server. No tokens are spent, SipAI never sees a login token, and nothing is stored or sent anywhere. If every agent runs on an API key there is nothing to show and the icon stays hidden; API usage and cost live on each provider's developer platform." : {
      "comment" : "FAQ answer: plan consumption",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "可以——点击工具栏中搜索图标旁边的 T 图标。当至少一个智能体工具登录了套餐（Claude 订阅、Codex 的 ChatGPT 套餐或 Kimi Code 会员）时它就会出现，并显示各套餐报告的内容：Claude Code 当前的 5 小时会话窗口和每周窗口，Codex 的每周额度和各模型限额，以及 Kimi Code 的每周配额和 5 小时窗口。数字在你打开窗口时获取，新鲜程度以底部显示的时间为准；点击刷新箭头可重新读取。每个数字都来自该工具自身的账户查询，由该工具在你的 Mac 上自行运行：Claude Code 回答它的 /usage 命令，Codex 通过它的 app server 回答，Kimi Code 通过它的本地服务器回答。不消耗任何 token，SipAI 从不接触登录令牌，也不会存储或发送任何内容。如果所有智能体都使用 API 密钥，则没有可显示的内容，图标会保持隐藏；API 用量和费用请到各提供商的开发者平台查看。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Yesterday" : {
      "comment" : "Date group",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "昨天"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "You" : {
      "comment" : "Default label shown above the user's own messages",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "你"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "You are a senior code reviewer. When the user shares code, analyze it for: bugs and logic errors, security vulnerabilities, performance issues, readability and style. Be specific — reference line numbers when possible. Suggest concrete fixes. If the code is good, say so briefly. If no code is shared, ask for it." : {
      "comment" : "System prompt of the built-in starter role shipped on a fresh install",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "你是一位资深的代码审查员。当用户分享代码时，请从这些方面进行分析：缺陷与逻辑错误、安全漏洞、性能问题、可读性与代码风格。请给出具体意见——尽可能标注行号。给出可直接落地的修改建议。如果代码本身没有问题，简要说明即可。如果用户没有提供代码，请主动索取。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "You can install a tool below or in Terminal. Either way, SipAI notices within a few seconds. Sign In opens the provider's own sign-in page. The tool keeps its own login, just as it does in Terminal." : {
      "comment" : "Agent Guide intro, second paragraph: installing and signing in",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "你可以在下方安装工具，也可以在“终端”里安装。无论哪种方式，SipAI 都会在几秒内检测到。“登录”会打开提供商自己的登录页面。登录信息由工具自己保存，和在“终端”里一样。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "You're about to be taken to %@ to sign in. Finish there and come back to SipAI — the row updates by itself. The tool stores its own login on this Mac; SipAI never sees your password or a token." : {
      "comment" : "Agent Guide: body of the browser notice; placeholder is the website's host",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "即将前往 %@ 登录。在那里完成后回到 SipAI 即可——这一行会自动更新。登录信息由工具保存在这台 Mac 上；SipAI 不会看到你的密码或令牌。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Your AI, your way." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "让你的 AI 更高效"
          }
        }
      }
    },
